051261709402320", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_1051261712735653_3438541724928627709_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=INHFb4NNGSwQ7kNvwGSu5Di&_nc_oc=AdkWs3_0sYH08RaG56aD3emZ8nfzxQrIstWEiRJpIXfYPq46W3x2lAlBgHYFsNqnT9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwt3osPQ9CaxvcMAr-5qeeNuSAiPbrmCJ3dZMAHuVdk1w&oe=69BD277C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hunt Together KeyArt_Video Cover 2560x1440.png", "id": "859547265899781", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031500_859547269233114_6874294734507533955_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4XF6ATkPiWoQ7kNvwG_vgYw&_nc_oc=AdmE-qd-zhXFEwMkbvOl1g8PSv4d7fCQrUFC6rgJQa9Fxx5o14RDm34KIJVLhh8VA8Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxE-_2-rjTUhCRtinR1hXM1hle42KmRh2h_0YLLRy_DGw&oe=69BD3DEC"}, "display_name": "Hunt Together", "keywords": ["Horror", "PVP", "Action", "Multiplayer", "Online"], "long_description": "Challenge your friends in a PvP VR Horror game (with Meta Quest x PCVR crossplay)! \ud83d\udc7b\n\nFeel the thrill of a hunt in a 1v1 Duel or up to 1v3 Hide and Seek mode that will push your wits, perceptiveness, and courage to their very limits \ud83d\ude31 Employ a wide array of items, triggers, and skills tailored to your class to outsmart and defeat your adversary - a terrifying, lifeforce-draining Ghost or a dauntless, vigilant Hunter. All of this set in spine-chilling locations such as a haunted Mansion, Mines, or a horrid Orphanage.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Challenge your friends in a spooky horror PvP system with 1v1 and up to 1v4 modes\n\u2022 Meta Quest x PCVR Crossplay\n\u2022 Two unique classes with dedicated skills and items\n\u2022 A suspenseful vibe of psychological horror\n\u2022 Haunted locations abound with possibilities and usable environment elements\n\u2022 Skins to customize your favorite character\n\u2022 Events and updates with new con